# This website needs NO secrets or environment variables.
# It is a static site: Vercel serves the files as they are.
#
# If you ever add a feature that needs one (for example a contact-form service),
# write only the NAME here, never the real value, like this:
# FORM_ENDPOINT=
#
# Put real values only in Vercel (Project → Settings → Environment Variables)
# or GitHub (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions). Never in this file.
